sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Player
    participant C as Client
    participant R as Route
    participant V as Validator
    participant Ctl as Controller
    participant S as Service
    participant R2 as Repository
    participant D as Database

    P->>C: Enter answer
    C->>R: POST /sessions/:code/answers + Bearer token
    R->>V: Validate input
    V-->>R: matchedData
    R->>Ctl: submitAnswer()
    Ctl->>S: submitAnswer()
    S->>R2: findBySessionAndUser()
    R2->>D: SELECT player
    D-->>R2: player row
    R2-->>S: player
    S->>R2: getCurrentQuestion()
    R2->>D: SELECT question + choices
    D-->>R2: question row
    R2-->>S: question
    S->>S: pointsFor()
    S->>R2: recordAnswerAndScore()
    R2->>D: INSERT answer + UPDATE score
    D-->>R2: answer row
    R2-->>S: committed
    S-->>Ctl: {points, is_correct, elapsed_ms}
    Ctl-->>R: 200 + result
    R-->>C: JSON response
    C-->>P: Show points earned